": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EeNEtO3prs8Q7kNvwEIlysv&_nc_oc=AdpUyigGlUarEhw66y-T869cxTTz6lHu4m84sEE9gaWHSqtAz3OTK5PUBuhbn9g0thE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKvipYl16qH4pjXwyeWPVjnfZe8rGWq5jlS0ph0w0yS1A&oe=6A9ECE17"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eUYjjLq8KyMQ7kNvwFZhGum&_nc_oc=AdpwRWS3GQ7oYXZ_WCP0xKMqxww1twdMS5j0JueFTEKHh5gtzV1Yspp0xUN0GpNyx-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIUOFfe0UnJ2MlCRLjt84CNz3wsOK0wTKrfXBXdn-XjAg&oe=6A9ED80B"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=meWPBvxPFbMQ7kNvwFPWbNS&_nc_oc=AdoQtCSVfRxk6Y7lU84YRJ7K5mA5-3ZZ5ObacAzpYvh8GLtkYiNsK7Wypw6DdCp8LRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJA2IPomPZB5ERY9eyLO6IWaQeBH3vcOQVCutJqSkc9Yg&oe=6A9ED90E"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0WdqFg-w5r8Q7kNvwF5yTXL&_nc_oc=AdrCtCrOBUPJdsv5-mB3r40TlMlgOXtR6dbi6LHK3M6sJoM4ZBGgJNjADXqB9ADa1Pg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJsBZIyfLthvYs21tkABrf6Jootx3uY73O2GhSxwr6G7A&oe=6A9EC236"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H19FwexpWxIQ7kNvwEIrB4H&_nc_oc=Adq-rxCO8H1I2utbw8ClDRDdbIPBZF7EAcNG_nqUkRewcAqyPpq4fL4cjQVgdlONnEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIUCg435MfpgHXsod9rMqxCc1BwPqrh_hJYbChKbwJX3Q&oe=6A9ECE14"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OFI2vdMOXSAQ7kNvwEqa67M&_nc_oc=AdpKkb_osYDBJvhjvayWVmGNte9ebi7jWpsbim8OqvPmxenIcmUKCt_ul5jQXcYcyE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKAChab_fX-yo16yuVC2ncym6GEH_c1inJNadsJRh1ubA&oe=6A9EAB13"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco